Description: DragonPBX all-in-one SIP/media stack
 Self-contained single-host DragonPBX deployment. Bundles drachtio-server
 (SIP server) and rtpengine (RTP media proxy, with a DKMS kernel module built
 against the running kernel at install time), vendors redis, and ships the
 DragonPBX application/config layer plus systemd units to run them together.
